        <p class="hint">支持 ${_d(a0_0x21975d(0x69c,'\x24\x6e\x79\x4f')+'\x33\x4d\x31')}://（可带 user:pass@）、http(s)://、${_d(a0_0x21975d(0xa52,'\x67\x42\x55\x4e')+'\x79\x38\x3d')} 或 host:port（默认按 ${_d(a0_0x21975d(0x19b6,'\x78\x68\x73\x69')+'\x33\x4d\x31')}，端口 1080）。此项控制 Worker 的真实转发出口，不会作为节点字段写进订阅；验证出口 IP 时请选择“仅走出口（only）”，默认模式在代理失败时会回退直连。SS 加密支持 ${_d(a0_0x21975d(0x16ca,'\x71\x30\x64\x70')+'\x54\x45\x79\x4f\x43'+a0_0x21975d(0x1247,'\x73\x4d\x69\x50')+'\x3d')} / ${_d(a0_0x21975d(0x35e9,'\x4f\x76\x26\x6d')+a0_0x21975d(0x1cc5,'\x77\x41\x78\x72')+a0_0x21975d(0x2e45,'\x62\x74\x4f\x51')+'\x3d')} / ${_d(a0_0x21975d(0x762,'\x41\x62\x28\x30')+a0_0x21975d(0x3342,'\x6b\x78\x53\x5a')+'\x41\x3d')}-ietf-poly1305。</p>
